{
  "id": "js-telegram",
  "name": "05 Telegram commands",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 05 Telegram commands\nEvery minute: asks the service to read new Telegram messages and act on commands from **your chat only** (`/approve 24`, `/skip 24`, `/applied 24`, `/tailor 24`, `/review`, `/status`, `/budget`, `/settings`, `/set ...`; send `/help`). Needs no public URL: it polls.\n\nThis runs 1,440 times a day; n8n prunes old executions after 3 days (see `EXECUTIONS_DATA_MAX_AGE`). **Credentials needed:** none (the service holds the bot token). It does nothing when Telegram is off.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -330
      ],
      "id": "7bb63012-b6cc-59f7-b39e-534212362374",
      "name": "Notes"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "ab505f12-909c-5b91-ad8f-59115238830d",
      "name": "Every minute"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://scraper:8000/telegram/poll",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 600000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({}) }}"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        260,
